*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Eval output written by eval.py (gitignored but created locally).
# Scoped to <org>/evals/results/ on purpose: a bare `results/` also matched
# web/app/api/evals/run/[runId]/results/, silently keeping that API route out
# of the repo entirely. The leading **/ matters: a pattern containing a slash
# is anchored to the repo root, so plain `evals/results/` would miss
# texans/evals/results/.
**/evals/results/

# Web UI (Next.js)
node_modules/
.next/
web/data/
*.tsbuildinfo
# Build-time copies of <org>/evals/cases.json (see web/scripts/collect-cases.mjs).
# The repo-root files remain the source of truth.
web/evals/
# root Python ignore has a bare `lib/` pattern; the web app's lib/ is source
!web/lib/
